---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ATEX Certification in India | Directive 2014/34/EU | Eurocert"
  description="ATEX certification and compliance support for equipment used in explosive atmospheres under Directive 2014/34/EU, including assessment and technical guidance."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/atex/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,ATEX certification,Directive 2014/34/EU,explosive atmospheres,explosion protection,CE marking ATEX"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784010164/atex_ohfzak.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25" alt="ATEX Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/80 via-transparent to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-24"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-6 font-bold">Explosive Atmospheres Directive</h4><h1 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(212,168,67,0.4)">ATEX Certification for Equipment in Explosive Atmospheres</h1><h3 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="250" class="heading-font text-white/80 text-base md:text-xl uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">(2014/34/EU)</h3><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" data-reveal-delay="350" class="w-24 h-0.5 bg-eurogold-400 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,168,67,0.6)]"></div><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="450" class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">ATEX certification for equipment intended for use in potentially explosive atmospheres, assessed under EU Directive 2014/34/EU</p></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="space-y-8"><div data-reveal="reveal-left"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ATEX Certification<br/><span class="text-euro-600">Explosive Atmospheres</span></h2></div><p data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="150" class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">We provide comprehensive ATEX certification services for equipment and protective systems intended for use in potentially explosive atmospheres.</p><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="250" class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50/50"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What is ATEX?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">ATEX (Atmosphères Explosibles) certification is required under Directive 2014/34/EU for equipment and protective systems intended for use in potentially explosive atmospheres. It covers equipment used in mining, chemical, petrochemical, and other industries where explosive gas, dust, or vapor may be present.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_32px_80px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-slate-100 h-[350px] sm:h-[450px] md:h-[550px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784010270/ate_h_llk6sc.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="ATEX Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/30 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Comprehensive Services</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Service Nodes</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Equipment Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope ATEX certification for equipment in explosive atmospheres.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Risk Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive explosive atmosphere risk assessment and zone classification.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert guidance on ATEX requirements and safety documentation.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="300" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring for ATEX regulation updates and equipment changes.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="400" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Technical documentation and ATEX compliance certification records.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="500" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Remediation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Addressing non-conformities in equipment for explosive atmospheres.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.08)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16"><div><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Key Advantages</h4><h3 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-10">Benefits Protocol</h3><div class="space-y-6"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="0" class="flex gap-4 group"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide heading-font">Regulatory Compliance</h5><p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Meet all ATEX directive requirements for explosive atmosphere equipment.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="100" class="flex gap-4 group"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide heading-font">Market Access</h5><p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Access to European markets for equipment used in hazardous areas.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="200" class="flex gap-4 group"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide heading-font">Safety Assurance</h5><p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Demonstrate commitment to explosion protection standards.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="300" class="flex gap-4 group"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide heading-font">Competitive Advantage</h5><p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Stand out as an ATEX-certified equipment manufacturer.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="400" class="flex gap-4 group"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide heading-font">Risk Management</h5><p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Reduce risks associated with explosive atmosphere operations.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">Why Eurocert Asia?</h3><p class="text-white/50 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">Our experienced auditors understand ATEX requirements and can guide you through the certification process.</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-4xl block mb-2 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] heading-font">Years of Industrial Intelligence</span></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-4xl block mb-2 leading-none">EU</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] heading-font">Directive Based Assessment</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Protocols</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><a data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="group relative h-[380px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] transition-all duration-500" href="/ped/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367997/eurocert/c6.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/30 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-6 right-6 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">PED</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Pressure Equipment</span></div></a><a data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="group relative h-[380px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] transition-all duration-500" href="/machinery/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367990/eurocert/c4.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/30 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-6 right-6 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Machinery</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">CE Certification</span></div></a><a data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="300" class="group relative h-[380px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] transition-all duration-500" href="/lvd-emc/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368005/eurocert/c8.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/30 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-6 right-6 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">LVD/EMC</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">CE Compliance</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto p-12 sm:p-16 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-4 font-bold">Initiate ATEX Compliance</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/50 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Our explosive atmosphere experts are ready to guide your organization through ATEX compliance and certification.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-white/30 text-xs heading-font tracking-widest uppercase mb-8"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-eurogold-400/60"></i><span>Bureau headquarters - Eurocert Inspection Services, Panchkula, Haryana, India</span><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse"></span></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-10 py-5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/#contact">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/20 rounded-full px-10 py-5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[10px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">The Law</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ATEX Directive <span class="text-euro-600">2014/34/EU</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The ATEX directive 2014/34/EU sets the essential health and safety requirements for equipment and protective systems intended for use in potentially explosive atmospheres. It has applied since 20 April 2016, replacing the earlier directive 94/9/EC. Equipment that complies is CE marked and carries the Ex marking, which is required to place it lawfully on the EU market.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Hazard Levels</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Equipment Categories <span class="text-euro-600">and Zones</span></h2></div><p>ATEX equipment is divided into three categories by the level of protection, matching the probability of an explosive atmosphere.</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5"><li><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Category 1</strong> - very high protection, for Zone 0 (gas) and Zone 20 (dust) where explosive atmospheres are present continuously</li><li><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Category 2</strong> - high protection, for Zone 1 and Zone 21 where explosive atmospheres are likely in normal operation</li><li><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Category 3</strong> - normal protection, for Zone 2 and Zone 22 where explosive atmospheres are unlikely and only short-lived</li></ul><p>Choosing the wrong category is the most common compliance failure. Part of our conformity assessment is confirming the intended zone of use so the classification and marking match the application.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">How It Works</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Notified Body &amp; <span class="text-euro-600">Conformity Assessment</span></h2></div><p>For Category 1 and most Category 2 products, a <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">notified body</strong> must be involved in the conformity assessment. Eurocert manages the complete assessment on your behalf - preparation of the technical file, testing coordination, EU-type examination procedures and the notified body dossier - so the route ends cleanly with a CE declaration of conformity (DoC), the EU-type examination certificate, the Ex nameplate and the notified body identification number.</p><p>The technical file you keep must include the design and drawings, the test evidence, the risk assessment for ignition sources, and the quality documentation. Explosion-protection testing covers ignition source assessment, temperature classification, enclosure integrity and similar specific checks.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Planning</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Cost, Timeline &amp; <span class="text-euro-600">ATEX vs IECEx</span></h2></div><p>ATEX certification cost depends on the product type, protection concept, test scope and category. Typical projects range from a few thousand euros for Category 3 self-certification support to substantially more for Category 1 projects involving full EU-type examination and testing. Lead time is commonly four to twelve weeks once the technical file is complete.</p><p>ATEX is the EU legal regime. IECEx is the international voluntary certification scheme for explosive atmospheres equipment recognised in many markets, including Australia, the Middle East, Russia and parts of Asia. Manufacturer who export to both the EU and other markets often hold ATEX and IECEx certification in parallel because the underlying product and test requirements are closely aligned.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Related Directives</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ATEX and the <span class="text-euro-600">Wider CE Picture</span></h2></div><p>Ex equipment almost always needs more than ATEX. Motors and drives may also fall under the machinery directive, and electrical enclosures under LVD and EMC requirements, while pumps and vessels may be in scope of the pressure equipment directive. Eurocert coordinates the full CE marking stack for the same product, so you avoid duplicate testing and missed modules: <a href="/machinery/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">machinery</a>, <a href="/lvd-emc/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">LVD / EMC</a>, <a href="/ped/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">PED</a>, <a href="/pi-mark/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">TPED (pi mark)</a>, <a href="/rohs/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">RoHS</a>, <a href="/reach/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">REACH</a>, and <a href="/lifts/" class="text-euro-600 font-semibold hover:underline">lifts</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">FAQ</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ATEX Certification <span class="text-euro-600">FAQ</span></h2></div><details class="seo-faq"><summary>What is the difference between ATEX 94/9/EC and 2014/34/EU?</summary><div class="ans">2014/34/EU is the recast of the older directive. It applies since April 2016 and is harmonised with the new legislative framework. Products certified under 94/9/EC could remain on the market for a transition period that has now ended.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Is ATEX certification required for every product in an Ex area?</summary><div class="ans">ATEX applies to equipment and protective systems placed on the market for use in explosive atmospheres. Installation and maintenance in the workplace are separately regulated under directive 1999/92/EC.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Can I export ATEX-certified equipment outside the EU?</summary><div class="ans">You still need to check the destination market. Many non-EU countries recognise IECEx or require national approval, so a combined ATEX and IECEx project is often the smartest route.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Does Eurocert test the equipment?</summary><div class="ans">Our conformity assessment includes evaluation of your test evidence and certifies the product; physical tests run in accredited laboratories where the protection concept requires them, and we coordinate that testing for you.</div></details></div></div></section><style is:global>.seo-faq{border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}.seo-faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:16px 20px;font-weight:700;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#0f172a}.seo-faq summary::after{content:"+";color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:800}.seo-faq .ans{padding:0 20px 16px;color:#64748b;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}</style>
</BaseLayout>
